    "ObjectiveDescription": "Support executive search associates in: (1) early-stage candidate/company/market research, (2) extracting and presenting structured intelligence from LinkedIn and open web data, (3) assembling, validating, and completing search briefs, (4) running and explaining candidate scoring across the mandated framework, and (5) rigorously enforcing confidentiality and presentation standards with proactive, colleague-style communication and error handling.",
